{"title": "Components/Alerts & Notifications/Toast", "stories": {"components-toast--example": {"html": "<div><div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; max-width: 544px; padding: 4px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\"><div class=\"ODSRow ODSNotification ODSNotification-variant-toast ODSNotification-mode-success ODSToast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"assertive\" data-scheme=\"inverted\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></div><br><button class=\"ODSRow ODSButton ODSButton--size-small ODSButton--buttonType-standard ODSButton--variant-primary ODSButton-ButtonBg--variant-primary ODSButton-ButtonBg ODSButton-ButtonBg--buttonType-standard ODSButton-ButtonBg--size-small\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle Toast\" aria-busy=\"false\"><div class=\"ODSButton-ButtonBgElement\"></div><div class=\"ODSRow ODSButton-Content ODSButton-Content--size-small ODSButton-Content--buttonType-standard\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"ODSButton-Label\">Toggle Toast</span></div></button></div></div></div>", "portal": "<div id=\"storybook-highlights-root\" style=\"\"><div id=\"storybook-highlights-menu\" popover=\"manual\" style=\"display: none;\"></div><style>\n            #storybook-highlights-menu {\n              position: absolute;\n              z-index: 2147483647;\n              width: 300px;\n              padding: 0px;\n              margin: 15px 0 0 0;\n              transform: translateX(-50%);\n              font-family: \"Nunito Sans\", -apple-system, \".SFNSText-Regular\", \"San Francisco\", BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n              font-size: 12px;\n              background: white;\n              border: none;\n              border-radius: 6px;\n              box-shadow: 0 2px 5px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 5px 15px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n              color: #2E3438;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu ul {\n              list-style: none;\n              margin: 0;\n              padding: 0;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu > ul {\n              max-height: 300px;\n              overflow-y: auto;\n              padding: 4px 0;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li {\n              padding: 0 4px;\n              margin: 0;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li > :not(ul) {\n              display: flex;\n              padding: 8px;\n              margin: 0;\n              align-items: center;\n              gap: 8px;\n              border-radius: 4px;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu button {\n              width: 100%;\n              border: 0;\n              background: transparent;\n              color: inherit;\n              text-align: left;\n              font-family: inherit;\n              font-size: inherit;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu button:focus-visible {\n              outline-color: #029CFD;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu button:hover {\n              background: rgba(2, 156, 253, 0.07);\n              color: #029CFD;\n              cursor: pointer;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li code {\n              white-space: nowrap;\n              overflow: hidden;\n              text-overflow: ellipsis;\n              line-height: 16px;\n              font-size: 11px;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li svg {\n              flex-shrink: 0;\n              margin: 1px;\n              color: #73828C;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li > button:hover svg, #storybook-highlights-menu li > button:focus-visible svg {\n              color: #029CFD;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu .element-list li svg {\n              display: none;\n            }\n            #storybook-highlights-menu li.selectable svg, #storybook-highlights-menu li.selected svg {\n              display: block;\n            }\n            #sto